  "minimum_window_rationale": "drand Quicknet period = 3 s/round. No protocol-level minimum exists. Initial v1 policy set both windows to 604800 s (7 d) for conservative audit margin, then revised to 1800 s (30 min) on 2026-10-12. The 30-min window violated the 7-day conservative baseline (DEPRECATED.md §5/§8.5) and is being replaced. The v2 window from 2026-10-14 is 3600 s (1 h) per stage, total 2 h. Rationale: (a) Quicknet 1200-round depth under BLS threshold signature at standard t-of-n assumptions is sufficient to defeat opportunistic early reveal at this window; (b) the full v2 mechanism (E1a+E1b+E2 prediction freeze + 2 distinct-device replicas + plaintext chmod-000+rename-sealed-off + GitHub workflow attestation + pre-removal inventory) is in place; (c) the researcher accepted the trade-off of shorter window for thesis timeline. The disclosure text is committed in v2 freeze-manifest.md §6.",
